#* {{RQ:Scott Tales of My Landlord 4|volume=II|chapter=XII|page=305|passage=The detachment of Tancred, fifty spears and their armed retinue, which amounted fully to five hundred men, after having taken a short and hasty refreshment, were in arms and mounted before the '''sultry''' hour of noon.}}
